       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ عَنَّانٌ عَنِ الخَيْرِ</span> <i>He is</i> [<i>one who holds back
